# Source-only repository: ignore everything by default.
*

# Keep directories traversable so source files can be discovered.
!*/

# Source code and source-level project files.
!*.py
!*.pyi
!*.ui
!*.qrc
!*.spec
!*.md
!*.rst
!*.toml
!*.yml
!*.yaml
!*.ini
!*.cfg
!*.json
!*.ico
!.gitignore

